  "_note": "Approval fails closed. Approve (captured responder) -> /approve -> /deliver -> DG office post: the ONLY route to delivery. Disapprove (captured responder) -> /disapprove (status disapproved, who/when) -> stop, no email: an explicit decision, already visible in the Slack thread. No decision before the 120-min wait expires (the node then outputs its input, with no data.approved) or a click with no captured responder -> Slack @here ping + email to $env.ANALYST_TEAM_EMAIL, in parallel; neither reaches delivery. The API also refuses /deliver for anything not 'approved'. Email needs an SMTP credential selected in the n8n UI."
